      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will form a dense, adherent, low-porosity ZrC layer over the boride substrate.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense, low-porosity ZrC layer will minimize microdefects and effective pathways for aluminum attack.",
